              "en": "We don't know where to park downtown."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Sabes== quién vino ayer al taller?",
              "en": "Do you know who came to the shop yesterday?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Sé== abrir un Tsuru sin llave.",
              "en": "I know how to open a Tsuru without a key."
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==Conoces== a Beto?",
              "en": "Do you know Beto?"
            },
            {
              "es": "No ==conozco== Oaxaca.",
              "en": "I've never been to Oaxaca."
            },
            {
              "es": "==Conocí== a mi esposa en la playa.",
              "en": "I met my wife at the beach."
